<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Argentine</p>
<p>Clausura soccer championship matches played at the weekend.</p>
<p> Gimnasia-La Plata	3    Banfield		     1</p>
<p> Huracan Corrientes     1    Gimnasia-Jujuy	     1</p>
<p> Lanus			3    Colon			  4</p>
<p> Independiente	    2    Huracan			0</p>
<p> Newell's Old Boys	1    Boca Juniors		 1</p>
<p> San Lorenzo		0    Estudiantes		  1</p>
<p> Union			1    Racing Club		  1</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Colon			   8  5  3  0 18  9 18</p>
<p> River Plate		   7  5  2  0 17  5 17</p>
<p> Newell's Old Boys	   8  5  2  1 12  7 17</p>
<p> San Lorenzo		   8  4  1  3 18 11 13</p>
<p> Gimnasia-La Plata	   8  4  1  3  8  7 13</p>
<p> Union			   8  3  3  2 11 13 12</p>
<p> Independiente		 8  3  2  3 14 14 11</p>
<p> Racing Club		   8  3  2  3  8 11 11</p>
<p> Velez Sarsfield	     7  3  1  3  8  8 10</p>
<p> Boca Juniors		  8  2  4  2 12 13 10</p>
<p> Rosario Central	     7  2  3  2  8  6  9</p>
<p> Platense			7  2  3  2 10 10  9</p>
<p> Ferro Carril Oeste	  7  2  3  2 10 10  9</p>
<p> Lanus			   8  1  5  2  8  8  8</p>
<p> Huracan Corrientes	  8  0  7  1  7 10  7</p>
<p> Gimnasia-Jujuy		8  1  4  3 10 14  7</p>
<p> Estudiantes		   8  2  1  5  7 11  7</p>
<p> Deportivo Espanol	   7  1  3  3  9 11  6</p>
<p> Banfield			8  1  2  5  7 14  5</p>
<p> Huracan			 8  1  2  5  8 18  5</p>
<p>Note: the Clausura is the second of two championships</p>
<p>played in the Argentine season. The teams meet each other once</p>
<p>in each and there is no overall champion.</p>
